# Before/After Record: [NAME]

<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: before-after | v2.2 -->
<!-- HVR_REFERENCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-with-human-voice/references/hvr-rules.md -->

> [One line: what this record compares and why it matters.]

---

<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->
## 1. METADATA

**Subject:** [SUBJECT]
**Status:** [Draft/Accepted/Archived]
**Date:** [YYYY-MM-DD]
**Owner:** [NAME OR ROLE]
**Related packet:** [PATH OR NONE]
<!-- /ANCHOR:metadata -->

---

<!-- ANCHOR:summary -->
## 2. SUMMARY

**What changed:** [CONCISE DESCRIPTION OF THE CHANGE].

**Why it changed:** [THE DRIVER, PROBLEM OR DECISION THAT CAUSED IT].
<!-- /ANCHOR:summary -->

---

<!-- ANCHOR:comparison -->
## 3. COMPARISON

Write one block per aspect the change touched. Name the aspect, state how it was, then state how it is now. Keep it prose. Do not use a table.

**[ASPECT]**
Before: [PREVIOUS STATE].
After: [CURRENT STATE].

**[ASPECT]**
Before: [PREVIOUS STATE].
After: [CURRENT STATE].
<!-- /ANCHOR:comparison -->

---

<!-- ANCHOR:net-effect -->
## 4. NET EFFECT

**Behavior:** [WHAT A USER OR THE SYSTEM DOES DIFFERENTLY].
**Operational impact:** [RUNTIME, SUPPORT OR PROCESS EFFECT].
**Follow-up:** [REQUIRED FOLLOW-UP, OR NONE].
<!-- /ANCHOR:net-effect -->

---

<!-- ANCHOR:notes-caveats -->
## 5. NOTES & CAVEATS

[LIMIT, ASSUMPTION, EXCEPTION OR EVIDENCE NOTE. Write "None" if nothing applies.]
<!-- /ANCHOR:notes-caveats -->"
`;

