**Duration**: ~60s
**Agent**: Primary

### Tier 2: Parallel Execution
| Agent | Focus | Files |
|-------|-------|-------|
| Plan Agent | plan.md | Technical approach |
| Checklist Agent | tasks.md | Verification items |
| Requirements Agent | spec.md (4-6) | Requirements detail |

**Duration**: ~90s (parallel)

